# 🤖 Conversational AI Dataset

> *A comprehensive conversational dataset created for training and fine-tuning AI chatbots.*

## 📋 Overview
This dataset contains **189+ human-written conversation pairs** across **14 intents**, perfect for training AI chatbots and conversational agents.

## 🎯 Included Intents
- 👋 Greeting
- ✌️ Goodbye  
- 🤝 Introduction
- 🙏 Thanks
- 😔 Apology
- ✅ Yes
- ❌ No
- 💬 Small Talk
- 😊 Happy
- 😢 Sad
- 💭 Emotions
- 😂 Joke
- 🆘 Help
- 👍 Agree
- 👎 Disagree

## 📁 File Format
| Column | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| `text` | User input/question |
| `intent` | Category/classification |
| `response` | AI/chatbot reply |

## 📊 Statistics
- **Total Pairs:** 189+
- **Total Intents:** 14
- **Format:** CSV
- **Language:** English 🇬🇧
